"\n<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"14\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"10\" y=\"9\" width=\"4\" height=\"11\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"16\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Lektion</div><div class=\"lk-big\">25</div><h1>비교급과 최상급</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Komparativ und Superlativ</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">둘을 비교할 때는 비교급 -er + als, 정도가 같을 때는 so … wie, 여럿 가운데 가장 앞설 때는 최상급 am -sten을 써요.<br>schnell · schneller · am schnellsten처럼 형용사 끝을 바꿔서 만들어요.<br>명사 앞에서는 23·24과의 형용사 어미를 그대로 붙여요 — der schnellste Zug · ein schnellerer Zug.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 과에서 익힐 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">비교급 -er과 최상급 -(e)sten을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">1음절 형용사의 움라우트와 불규칙형 gut·viel·gern·hoch·nah를 외워요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">als와 so … wie로 비교해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">최상급 am -sten과 der/die/das -ste를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">명사 앞 비교급·최상급에 어미를 붙여요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">immer + 비교급, je … desto를 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">'너무'를 sehr와 zu로 구별하고, genug의 자리를 지켜요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">복습</span><span class=\"sub-title\">16·23·24과 복습</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Das ist ein schön____ Tag.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) -er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) -es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) -e</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) -en</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ein + 남성 1격 → -er (24과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ich trinke gern kalt____ Milch.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) -es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) -er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) -e</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) -en</button></div><div class=\"qe\">관사 없음, 여성 4격 → -e (24과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Wir wohnen in dem groß____ Haus.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) -es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) -en</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) -em</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) -e</button></div><div class=\"qe\">정관사 3격 → -en (23과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> ____ des Regens bleiben wir hier. <span class=\"qh\">비 때문에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Wegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Statt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">이유 → wegen + 2격 (16과).</div></div></div>\n<section id=\"sec-A\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">A</span><h2>한국어로 먼저 보기</h2></div><p>한국어는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span> 앞에 '더', '가장'을 붙여서 비교해요 — 더 빠르다, 가장 빠르다.<br>형용사 '빠르다'는 그대로예요.<br>독일어는 형용사 끝에 -er, -sten을 붙여요 — schnell<span class=\"x-e\">er</span>, am schnell<span class=\"x-e\">sten</span>.</p><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">'더'는 -er, '가장'은 am -sten</div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>한국어</th><th>독일어</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>빠르다</td><td>schnell</td></tr><tr><td>더 빠르다</td><td>schnell<span class=\"x-e\">er</span></td></tr><tr><td>가장 빠르다</td><td>am schnell<span class=\"x-e\">sten</span></td></tr><tr><td>버스보다 더 빠르다</td><td>schnell<span class=\"x-e\">er</span> <strong>als</strong> der Bus</td></tr><tr><td>버스만큼 빠르다</td><td><strong>so</strong> schnell <strong>wie</strong> der Bus</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">영어 more beautiful처럼 긴 형용사에 mehr를 붙이지 않아요. 모든 형용사에 -er을 붙여요 — schön → schöner, interessant → interessanter.</div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-B\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">B</span><h2>비교급과 최상급 만들기</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'더 ~⁠한'은 -er, '가장 ~⁠한'은 am -sten을 붙여요 — schnell → schnell<strong>er</strong> → am schnell<strong>sten</strong>.</p></div></div><h3>기본 규칙</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>원급</th><th>비교급 (-er)</th><th>최상급 (am -sten)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>schnell 빠른</td><td>schnell<span class=\"x-e\">er</span></td><td>am schnell<span class=\"x-e\">sten</span></td></tr><tr><td>klein 작은</td><td>klein<span class=\"x-e\">er</span></td><td>am klein<span class=\"x-e\">sten</span></td></tr><tr><td>schön 아름다운</td><td>schön<span class=\"x-e\">er</span></td><td>am schön<span class=\"x-e\">sten</span></td></tr><tr><td>interessant 흥미로운</td><td>interessant<span class=\"x-e\">er</span></td><td>am interessant<span class=\"x-e\">esten</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>최상급에 -e-를 넣는 형용사</h3><p><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">어간<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">어간</span>동사원형에서 끝의 -en(-n)을 뗀 부분이에요. 여기에 인칭어미를 붙여요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen → lern-</span></span></span>이 -d·-t·-s·-ß·-sch·-z로 끝나면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">최상급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">최상급</span>여럿 가운데 '가장 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: am schnellsten · der schnellste Zug</span></span></span>에 -e-를 넣어 -esten으로 써요. 발음하기 쉽게 하려는 거예요.</p><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">alt → am ält<span class=\"x-e\">esten</span></span><span class=\"exl-ko\">나이 든</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">heiß → am heiß<span class=\"x-e\">esten</span></span><span class=\"exl-ko\">뜨거운</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">kurz → am kürz<span class=\"x-e\">esten</span></span><span class=\"exl-ko\">짧은</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">hübsch → am hübsch<span class=\"x-e\">esten</span></span><span class=\"exl-ko\">예쁜</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">breit → am breit<span class=\"x-e\">esten</span></span><span class=\"exl-ko\">넓은</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">groß는 예외</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">groß → größer → am größ<span class=\"x-e\">ten</span> — -ß로 끝나지만 -e-를 넣지 않아요.</p></div></div><h3>-el · -er로 끝나는 형용사</h3><p><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">비교급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">비교급</span>둘을 비교해 '더 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요. 형용사에 -er을 붙여요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: schnell → schneller als</span></span></span>에서 e가 빠져요. 최상급은 그대로예요.</p><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">dunkel → dunkl<span class=\"x-e\">er</span> → am dunkelsten</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">어두운</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">teuer → teur<span class=\"x-e\">er</span> → am teuersten</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">비싼</span></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-C\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">C</span><h2>움라우트와 불규칙형</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">짧은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span>는 모음에 점이 생기기도 하고(alt → älter), 아예 다른 말이 되기도 해요(gut → besser → am besten).</p></div></div><h3>1음절 형용사는 a·o·u에 움라우트가 붙는 경우가 많아요</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>원급</th><th>비교급</th><th>최상급</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>alt 나이 든</td><td><span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>lter</td><td>am <span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>ltesten</td></tr><tr><td>jung 젊은</td><td>j<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>nger</td><td>am j<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>ngsten</td></tr><tr><td>groß 큰</td><td>gr<span class=\"x-e\">ö</span>ßer</td><td>am gr<span class=\"x-e\">ö</span>ßten</td></tr><tr><td>lang 긴</td><td>l<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>nger</td><td>am l<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>ngsten</td></tr><tr><td>kurz 짧은</td><td>k<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>rzer</td><td>am k<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>rzesten</td></tr><tr><td>warm · kalt 따뜻한 · 추운</td><td>w<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>rmer · k<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>lter</td><td>am w<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>rmsten · am k<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>ltesten</td></tr><tr><td>stark · schwach 강한 · 약한</td><td>st<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>rker · schw<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>cher</td><td>am st<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>rksten · am schw<span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>chsten</td></tr><tr><td>arm · klug · oft</td><td><span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>rmer · kl<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>ger · <span class=\"x-e\">ö</span>fter</td><td>am <span class=\"x-e\">ä</span>rmsten · am kl<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>gsten · am <span class=\"x-e\">ö</span>ftesten</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">움라우트가 붙지 않는 1음절 형용사</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">klar → klarer · voll → voller · froh → froher · rund → runder · bunt → bunter · schlank → schlanker<br>1음절이라도 이 단어들은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">움라우트<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">움라우트</span>a·o·u 위에 점 두 개를 찍은 ä·ö·ü예요. 복수형·비교급·동사변화에서 모음이 이렇게 바뀌는 일이 많아요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Apfel → die Äpfel · alt → älter</span></span></span>가 없어요. 새 형용사는 사전에서 확인해요.</p></div></div><h3>불규칙형 — 통째로 외워요</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-first\"><thead><tr><th>원급</th><th>비교급</th><th>최상급</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>gut 좋은</td><td><strong>besser</strong></td><td>am <strong>besten</strong></td></tr><tr><td>viel 많은</td><td><strong>mehr</strong></td><td>am <strong>meisten</strong></td></tr><tr><td>gern 즐겨</td><td><strong>lieber</strong></td><td>am <strong>liebsten</strong></td></tr><tr><td>hoch 높은</td><td><strong>höher</strong></td><td>am <strong>höchsten</strong></td></tr><tr><td>nah 가까운</td><td><strong>näher</strong></td><td>am <strong>nächsten</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">형태 만들기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> klein의 비교급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) kleinerer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) kleinster</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mehr klein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) kleiner</button></div><div class=\"qe\">형용사 + -er.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> gut의 비교급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mehr gut</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) besser</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) guter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) güter</button></div><div class=\"qe\">불규칙 → besser.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> alt의 최상급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) am ältesten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) am älterten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am altesten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) am ältsten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">움라우트 + -t로 끝나서 -esten.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> jung의 비교급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) jüngerer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mehr jung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) junger</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) jünger</button></div><div class=\"qe\">1음절 + 움라우트 → jünger.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> hoch의 비교급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) hocher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) höcher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) höher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) hoher</button></div><div class=\"qe\">불규칙 → höher.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> groß의 최상급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) am größsten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) am größten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am grossten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) am größesten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">groß는 -e-를 넣지 않아요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> gern의 비교급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) gerner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) gernlicher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mehr gern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) lieber</button></div><div class=\"qe\">불규칙 → lieber.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> teuer의 비교급은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) teurer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) teuerner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mehr teuer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) teuerer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">-er로 끝나면 비교급에서 e가 빠져요.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-D\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">D</span><h2>비교하기 — als와 so … wie</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'~⁠보다 더'는 als, '~⁠만큼'은 so … wie로 말해요 — Er ist größer <strong>als</strong> ich. · Er ist <strong>so</strong> groß <strong>wie</strong> ich.</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 236\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"als는 차이가 있을 때, so … wie는 같을 때\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"compare-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"compare-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"compare-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"compare-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"compare-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"70.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"60.0\" height=\"130.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"40.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">180 cm</text><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"198.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">Tom</text><rect x=\"170.0\" y=\"74.0\" width=\"60.0\" height=\"104.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">165 cm</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"198.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">Anna</text><rect x=\"370.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"60.0\" height=\"130.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"400.0\" y=\"40.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">180 cm</text><text x=\"400.0\" y=\"198.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">Tom</text><rect x=\"470.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"60.0\" height=\"130.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"40.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">180 cm</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"198.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">Max</text><line x1=\"300.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"224.0\" class=\"f-ln\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"226.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\">Tom ist größer <tspan font-weight=\"700\">als</tspan> Anna.</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"226.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\">Tom ist <tspan font-weight=\"700\">so</tspan> groß <tspan font-weight=\"700\">wie</tspan> Max.</text></svg></div><figcaption>차이가 있으면 als, 같으면 so … wie</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Er ist größer als sie. 그는 그녀보다 키가 커요. Sie ist nicht so groß wie er. 그녀는 그만큼 크지 않아요.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Er ist <strong>größer als</strong> sie.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">그는 그녀보다 키가 커요.</span><span class=\"ph-de\">Sie ist <strong>nicht so</strong> groß <strong>wie</strong> er.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">그녀는 그만큼 크지 않아요.</span></div></figcaption></figure><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>관계</th><th>형태</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>더 ~⁠하다</td><td>비교급 + <strong>als</strong></td><td>Der Zug ist schneller <strong>als</strong> der Bus.</td></tr><tr><td>똑같이 ~⁠하다</td><td><strong>so</strong> + 원급 + <strong>wie</strong></td><td>Anna ist <strong>so</strong> groß <strong>wie</strong> Lisa.</td></tr><tr><td>~⁠만큼 ~⁠하지 않다</td><td><strong>nicht so</strong> + 원급 + <strong>wie</strong></td><td>Der Bus ist <strong>nicht so</strong> schnell <strong>wie</strong> der Zug.</td></tr><tr><td>정확히 같다</td><td><strong>genauso</strong> + 원급 + <strong>wie</strong></td><td>Das kostet <strong>genauso</strong> viel <strong>wie</strong> gestern.</td></tr><tr><td>두 배</td><td><strong>doppelt so</strong> + 원급 + <strong>wie</strong></td><td>Mein Zimmer ist <strong>doppelt so</strong> groß <strong>wie</strong> deins.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">als 뒤의 대명사는 1격</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">비교되는 두 대상은 같은 격이에요. <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">주어<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">주어</span>문장에서 동작이나 상태의 주인이에요. 독일어 주어는 1격이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Der Hund schläft. → der Hund</span></span></span>끼리 비교하면 als 뒤도 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">1격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">1격</span>문장의 주어 자리예요. 한국어 '~은/는·~이/가'에 해당해요. sein 뒤에서 주어를 설명하는 말도 1격이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Der Mann ist hier. 그 남자가 여기 있어요.</span></span></span>이에요.<br>Er ist größer <strong>als ich</strong>. 그는 나보다 커요. (✕ als mich)</p></div></div><h3>차이의 정도</h3><p>viel(훨씬)·noch(더욱)·etwas·ein bisschen(조금)을 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">비교급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">비교급</span>둘을 비교해 '더 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요. 형용사에 -er을 붙여요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: schnell → schneller als</span></span></span> 앞에 놓아요.</p><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das Auto ist <strong>viel</strong> teurer.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그 차는 훨씬 비싸요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Heute ist es <strong>noch</strong> kälter als gestern.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">오늘은 어제보다 더 추워요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Kannst du <strong>ein bisschen</strong> langsamer sprechen?</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">조금 더 천천히 말해 줄래?</span></div></div><h3>동사와 함께 — gern · lieber · am liebsten</h3><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich trinke <strong>gern</strong> Kaffee.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">커피를 즐겨 마셔요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich trinke <strong>lieber</strong> Tee <strong>als</strong> Kaffee.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">커피보다 차를 더 좋아해요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich trinke <strong>am liebsten</strong> Wasser.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">물을 제일 좋아해요.</span></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">비교하기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Mein Bruder ist älter ____ ich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) so</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wie</button></div><div class=\"qe\">비교급 + als.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Lisa ist so groß ____ Anna.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) so</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) wie</button></div><div class=\"qe\">so … wie.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Er spricht schneller als ____. <span class=\"qh\">나보다</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) ich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) mein</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어끼리 비교 → als ich.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Ich esse ____ Fisch als Fleisch. <span class=\"qh\">고기보다 생선을 더 좋아해요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) gerner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mehr gern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am liebsten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) lieber</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gern의 비교급 → lieber.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Heute ist es ____ wärmer als gestern. <span class=\"qh\">훨씬</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sehr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) viel</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mehr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) so</button></div><div class=\"qe\">비교급 강조 → viel.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Der Bus ist nicht so schnell ____ der Zug.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) so</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) wie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) als</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nicht so … wie.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-E\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">E</span><h2>최상급 — am -sten과 der -ste</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'가장'은 am -sten이나 der·die·das -ste로 말해요 — Er läuft <strong>am schnellsten</strong>. · der schnell<strong>ste</strong> Läufer.</p></div></div><p><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">최상급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">최상급</span>여럿 가운데 '가장 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: am schnellsten · der schnellste Zug</span></span></span>은 두 가지 모양으로 써요.</p><div class=\"dgm-contrast\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><div class=\"dgm-side\"><div class=\"dgm-side-t\">am -sten — 서술·부사</div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Er läuft <strong>am schnellsten</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">부사</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그가 제일 빨리 달려요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Dieser Zug ist <strong>am schnellsten</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">sein 뒤</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">이 기차가 제일 빨라요.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-side\"><div class=\"dgm-side-t\">der/die/das -ste — 명사 앞</div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">der <strong>schnellste</strong> Zug</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">가장 빠른 기차</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das ist <strong>die schönste</strong> Stadt.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그곳이 가장 아름다운 도시예요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Dieser Zug ist <strong>der schnellste</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">명사 생략</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">이 기차가 가장 빠른 기차예요.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">'~ 가운데'와 '~⁠에서'</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">가운데: von allen · unter den Schülern — Er ist der größte <strong>von allen</strong>.<br>범위: in + <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">3격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">3격</span>주로 '~에게'를 나타내는 자리예요. helfen·danken 같은 동사와 mit·bei·zu 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich gebe dem Kind ein Buch. 아이에게 책을 줘요.</span></span></span> 또는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">2격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">2격</span>'~의'를 나타내는 자리예요. 다른 명사 뒤에서 누구·무엇의 것인지 나타내요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: das Auto des Mannes 그 남자의 차</span></span></span> — der höchste Berg <strong>in Deutschland</strong> · der höchste Berg <strong>Deutschlands</strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">die meisten — 대부분</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">viel의 최상급 meist-는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">정관사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">정관사</span>말하는 사람과 듣는 사람이 모두 아는, 정해진 대상 앞에 쓰는 관사예요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der · die · das — das Buch 그 책</span></span></span>와 함께 '대부분'이라는 뜻으로 써요 — <strong>Die meisten</strong> Leute arbeiten am Montag. 대부분의 사람들은 월요일에 일해요.</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-F\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">F</span><h2>명사 앞의 비교급·최상급 — 어미를 붙여요</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">비교급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">비교급</span>둘을 비교해 '더 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요. 형용사에 -er을 붙여요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: schnell → schneller als</span></span></span>·<span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">최상급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">최상급</span>여럿 가운데 '가장 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: am schnellsten · der schnellste Zug</span></span></span>도 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 앞에 쓰면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span>처럼 끝을 붙여요 — ein schneller<strong>es</strong> Auto 더 빠른 차.</p></div></div><p>명사 앞에서는 비교급·최상급 뒤에 23·24과의 형용사 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">어미<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">어미</span>단어 끝에 붙어 문법 정보를 나타내는 부분이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lern-e · gut-er · Kind-er</span></span></span>를 붙여요. 비교급의 -er과 어미가 겹쳐도 그대로 써요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>명사구</th><th>분석</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>der schneller<span class=\"x-e\">e</span> Zug</td><td>비교급 schneller + 약변화 -e</td></tr><tr><td>ein schneller<span class=\"x-e\">er</span> Zug</td><td>비교급 schneller + 혼합변화 -er</td></tr><tr><td>mit einem größer<span class=\"x-e\">en</span> Auto</td><td>비교급 größer + 3격 -en</td></tr><tr><td>besser<span class=\"x-e\">e</span> Ideen</td><td>비교급 besser + 강변화 복수 -e</td></tr><tr><td>die schönst<span class=\"x-e\">e</span> Stadt</td><td>최상급 schönst- + 약변화 -e</td></tr><tr><td>im höchst<span class=\"x-e\">en</span> Gebäude</td><td>최상급 höchst- + 3격 -en</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">mehr와 weniger는 변하지 않아요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">mehr(더 많은)·weniger(더 적은)는 명사 앞에서도 어미를 붙이지 않아요 — Ich brauche <strong>mehr</strong> Zeit. · Wir haben <strong>weniger</strong> Geld.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">명사 앞 비교급·최상급</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich suche eine größer____ Wohnung.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) -en</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) -es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) -e</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) -er</button></div><div class=\"qe\">eine + 여성 4격 → -e.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Das ist der best____ Film.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) -en</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) -e</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) -er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) -es</button></div><div class=\"qe\">정관사 남성 1격 → -e.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Er fährt ein schneller____ Auto.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) -es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) -er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) -en</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) -e</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ein + 중성 4격 → -es.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Wir wohnen im höchst____ Haus.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) -e</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) -en</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) -em</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) -es</button></div><div class=\"qe\">3격 → -en.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Ich brauche ____ Zeit. <span class=\"qh\">더 많은 시간</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mehren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) meisten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mehre</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) mehr</button></div><div class=\"qe\">mehr는 어미가 없어요.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-G\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">G</span><h2>점점 더 — immer · je … desto</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">immer + <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">비교급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">비교급</span>둘을 비교해 '더 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요. 형용사에 -er을 붙여요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: schnell → schneller als</span></span></span>은 '점점 더', je … desto는 '~⁠할수록 더'예요 — Es wird <strong>immer kälter</strong>. 점점 추워져요.</p></div></div><h3>immer + 비교급 — 점점 더</h3><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Es wird <strong>immer kälter</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">점점 추워져요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Die Preise steigen <strong>immer mehr</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">물가가 점점 더 올라요.</span></div></div><h3>je + 비교급 …, desto + 비교급 … — ~⁠할수록 더 ~⁠하다</h3><p>je 부분은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">종속절<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">종속절</span>주절에 딸린 문장이에요. 활용된 동사가 맨 끝에 오고, 쉼표로 주절과 나눠요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: …, weil ich krank bin.</span></span></span>이라서 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사</span>동작이나 상태를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lernen 배우다 · sein ~이다</span></span></span>가 맨 끝이에요(20과). desto 부분은 desto + 비교급 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.</p><div class=\"klam\"><div class=\"klam-cells\"><div class=\"klam-c \"><span class=\"klam-pos\">비교급</span><span class=\"klam-w\">Je mehr</span></div><div class=\"klam-c \"><span class=\"klam-w\">ich</span></div><div class=\"klam-c klam-v\"><span class=\"klam-pos\">끝</span><span class=\"klam-w\">übe</span></div></div><div class=\"klam-tr\">연습을 많이 할수록 — je 부분은 동사가 끝</div></div><div class=\"klam\"><div class=\"klam-cells\"><div class=\"klam-c \"><span class=\"klam-pos\"><b class=\"kn\">1</b></span><span class=\"klam-w\">desto besser</span></div><div class=\"klam-c klam-v\"><span class=\"klam-pos\"><b class=\"kn\">2</b></span><span class=\"klam-w\">spreche</span></div><div class=\"klam-c \"><span class=\"klam-w\">ich</span></div></div><div class=\"klam-tr\">더 잘 말해요 — desto + 비교급 다음에 동사</div></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Je</strong> früher du kommst, <strong>desto</strong> besser.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">일찍 올수록 좋아.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Je</strong> älter er wird, <strong>umso</strong> ruhiger ist er.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">desto 대신 umso</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그는 나이가 들수록 차분해져요.</span></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-H\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">H</span><h2>zu · sehr · genug — '너무'와 '충분히'</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">sehr는 '아주', zu는 '지나쳐서 문제', genug는 '충분히'예요. 칭찬할 때는 zu가 아니라 sehr를 써요.</p></div></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Die Schuhe sind zu klein. 신발이 너무 작아요. 그래서 못 신어요 — sehr가 아니라 zu예요.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Die Schuhe sind <strong>zu</strong> klein.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">신발이 너무 작아요. 그래서 못 신어요 — sehr가 아니라 zu예요.</span></div></figcaption></figure><p>한국어 '너무'는 '너무 좋아요'처럼 칭찬에도, '너무 비싸요'처럼 문제를 말할 때도 써요.<br>독일어는 둘을 나눠요. 정도가 높다는 뜻은 sehr, 지나쳐서 문제가 된다는 뜻은 zu예요.</p><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">sehr는 정도, zu는 지나침</div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>독일어</th><th>뜻</th><th>들리는 느낌</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Das Hotel ist <strong>sehr</strong> teuer.</td><td>그 호텔은 아주 비싸요.</td><td>비싸지만 묵을 수도 있어요.</td></tr><tr><td>Das Hotel ist <strong>zu</strong> teuer.</td><td>그 호텔은 너무 비싸요.</td><td>비싸서 묵을 수 없어요.</td></tr><tr><td>Das Hotel ist <strong>viel zu</strong> teuer.</td><td>그 호텔은 지나치게 비싸요.</td><td>zu를 강조해요.</td></tr><tr><td>Das Essen ist <strong>sehr</strong> gut!</td><td>음식이 정말 맛있어요!</td><td>칭찬</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">칭찬할 때 zu를 쓰면 '지나치게 좋다'는 이상한 뜻이 돼요. 칭찬은 sehr · total · echt · super로 해요.</div></div><h3>zu와 함께 쓰는 표현</h3><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Die Schuhe sind <strong>zu</strong> klein <strong>für</strong> mich.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">zu … für + 4격</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그 신발은 나한테 너무 작아요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Der Kaffee ist <strong>zu</strong> heiß <strong>zum</strong> Trinken.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">zu … zum + 명사화한 동사</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">커피가 너무 뜨거워서 못 마셔요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Er ist <strong>zu</strong> müde, <strong>um</strong> weiter<strong>zu</strong>arbeiten.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">zu …, um … zu(28과)</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그는 너무 피곤해서 계속 일할 수 없어요.</span></div></div><h3>genug — 충분히</h3><p>genug는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span>·<span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">부사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">부사</span>동사·형용사·문장 전체를 꾸미는 말이에요. 형태가 변하지 않아요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: heute · gern · sehr · oft</span></span></span> 뒤에, <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 앞에 와요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>자리</th><th>예</th><th>뜻</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>형용사 + genug</td><td>Das Zimmer ist groß <strong>genug</strong>.</td><td>방이 충분히 커요.</td></tr><tr><td>nicht + 형용사 + genug</td><td>Das Wasser ist nicht warm <strong>genug</strong>.</td><td>물이 충분히 따뜻하지 않아요.</td></tr><tr><td>genug + 명사</td><td>Wir haben <strong>genug</strong> Zeit.</td><td>시간이 충분해요.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">genug를 형용사 앞에 두지 않아요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">✕ Das Zimmer ist genug groß. → ✓ Das Zimmer ist groß <strong>genug</strong>.<br>영어 big enough와 같은 순서예요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">zu · sehr · genug</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> (칭찬) '이 케이크 정말 맛있어요!'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Der Kuchen ist sehr lecker!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Der Kuchen ist lecker genug sehr!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Der Kuchen ist zu lecker!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Der Kuchen ist genug lecker!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">칭찬은 sehr, zu는 지나침.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Die Jacke ist ____ groß. Ich brauche eine kleinere.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sehr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) so</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) genug</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) zu</button></div><div class=\"qe\">커서 못 입음 → 문제 → zu.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> '우리는 시간이 충분해요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wir haben zu Zeit.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wir haben Zeit genug zu.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Wir haben genug Zeit.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir haben sehr Zeit.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">genug + 명사.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> '그 방은 충분히 밝아요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Das Zimmer ist hell genug.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Das Zimmer ist zu hell genug.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Das Zimmer ist genug hell.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Das Zimmer ist sehr genug hell.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">형용사 + genug.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Er ist ____ jung, um Auto zu fahren. <span class=\"qh\">너무 어려서 운전할 수 없어요</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) genug</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) so</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sehr</button></div><div class=\"qe\">zu …, um … zu.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-I\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">I</span><h2>가장 많이 하는 실수</h2></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 1</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">영어처럼 mehr를 붙여요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Das Buch ist mehr interessant.<span class=\"tx-n\">영어 more</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Das Buch ist interessanter.<span class=\"tx-n\">그 책이 더 재미있어요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">독일어는 긴 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span>도 -er을 붙여요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 2</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">비교급 뒤에 wie를 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Er ist größer wie ich.<span class=\"tx-n\">동등 비교 표현</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Er ist größer als ich.<span class=\"tx-n\">그는 나보다 커요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">비교급<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">비교급</span>둘을 비교해 '더 ~하다'를 나타내는 형태예요. 형용사에 -er을 붙여요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: schnell → schneller als</span></span></span>은 als, 같은 정도는 so … wie예요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 3</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">최상급을 명사 앞에 am으로 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">der am schnellsten Zug<span class=\"tx-n\">am + 명사</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">der schnellste Zug<span class=\"tx-n\">가장 빠른 기차</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 앞에서는 der/die/das + -ste + <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">어미<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">어미</span>단어 끝에 붙어 문법 정보를 나타내는 부분이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lern-e · gut-er · Kind-er</span></span></span>예요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 4</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">움라우트를 빼요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Mein Bruder ist alter.<span class=\"tx-n\">움라우트 없음</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Mein Bruder ist älter.<span class=\"tx-n\">형이 나이가 더 많아요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">alt·jung·groß·lang·kurz·warm·kalt는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">움라우트<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">움라우트</span>a·o·u 위에 점 두 개를 찍은 ä·ö·ü예요. 복수형·비교급·동사변화에서 모음이 이렇게 바뀌는 일이 많아요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Apfel → die Äpfel · alt → älter</span></span></span>가 붙어요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 5</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">칭찬에 zu를 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Das Essen ist zu lecker!<span class=\"tx-n\">한국어 '너무 맛있어요'</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Das Essen ist sehr lecker!<span class=\"tx-n\">음식이 정말 맛있어요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">zu는 지나쳐서 문제라는 뜻이에요. 정도가 높다는 뜻은 sehr예요.</div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">실수 피하기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Der Film ist so spannender als das Buch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Der Film ist spannender wie das Buch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Der Film ist mehr spannend als das Buch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Der Film ist spannender als das Buch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">비교급 -er + als.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Das ist am teuersten Restaurant.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Das ist das teuerstes Restaurant.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Das ist das teuerste Restaurant.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Das ist das am teuersten Restaurant.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사 앞 → das + -ste + -e.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Mein Zimmer ist größer wie deins.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Mein Zimmer ist größer als deins.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Mein Zimmer ist mehr groß als deins.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Mein Zimmer ist großer als deins.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">groß → größer, + als.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Je mehr ich lese, desto mehr verstehe ich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Je mehr lese ich, desto mehr verstehe ich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Je ich mehr lese, desto mehr ich verstehe.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Je mehr ich lese, desto ich verstehe mehr.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">je 부분은 동사 끝, desto + 비교급 + 동사 + 주어.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-J\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">J</span><h2>참고</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">비교 대상 없이 쓰는 비교급</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">eine ältere Dame처럼 비교 대상 없이 쓰면 '꽤 나이 든 부인'이라는 뜻이에요. 실제 나이가 '더 많다'는 비교가 아니에요.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">als 뒤에 문장</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">비교 대상이 문장이면 als 뒤에 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">종속절<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">종속절</span>주절에 딸린 문장이에요. 활용된 동사가 맨 끝에 오고, 쉼표로 주절과 나눠요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: …, weil ich krank bin.</span></span></span>이 와요 — Es ist teurer, <strong>als ich dachte</strong>. 생각했던 것보다 비싸요(20과).</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">최상급의 강조</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">aller-를 붙이면 '가장 ~⁠한 것 중에서도'라는 강조가 돼요 — am <strong>aller</strong>besten 정말 최고로.</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-K\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">K</span><h2>바로 쓰는 문장 · 일상 회화</h2></div><p>비교하고 고르는 문장이에요.</p><div class=\"exl talk-l\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Der Zug ist <strong>schneller als</strong> der Bus.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">데어 축 이스트 슈넬러 알스 데어 부스</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">기차가 버스보다 빨라요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich trinke <strong>lieber</strong> Tee.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">이히 트링케 리버 테</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">저는 차가 더 좋아요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das finde ich <strong>am besten</strong>.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">다스 핀데 이히 암 베스텐</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그게 제일 좋은 것 같아요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Seoul ist <strong>die größte</strong> Stadt in Korea.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">서울 이스트 디 그뢰스테 슈타트 인 코레아</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">서울은 한국에서 가장 큰 도시예요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Es wird <strong>immer kälter</strong>.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">에스 비어트 이머 켈터</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">점점 추워져요.</span></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-card\"><h2 class=\"sum-title\">이 과 정리</h2><div><div class=\"sum-li\">비교급은 -er, 최상급은 am -sten — 긴 형용사도 같아요, mehr를 붙이지 않아요</div><div class=\"sum-li\">-d·-t·-s·-ß·-sch·-z로 끝나면 최상급 -esten (groß만 예외), -el·-er은 비교급에서 e 탈락</div><div class=\"sum-li\">1음절 a·o·u는 움라우트가 많아요 — älter · jünger · größer</div><div class=\"sum-li\">불규칙 — gut besser am besten · viel mehr am meisten · gern lieber am liebsten · hoch höher · nah näher am nächsten</div><div class=\"sum-li\">비교급 + als, 같은 정도는 so … wie, als 뒤 주어는 1격</div><div class=\"sum-li\">최상급은 am -sten(서술·부사) / der -ste(명사 앞), 명사 앞에서는 23·24과 어미</div><div class=\"sum-li\">immer + 비교급 점점 더, je … desto ~⁠할수록 더</div><div class=\"sum-li\">sehr는 정도, zu는 지나침(그래서 문제) — 칭찬은 sehr, genug는 형용사 뒤·명사 앞</div></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">다음 ⏭ 26과</span><div>26과에서는 과거보다 더 앞선 일을 말하는 과거완료와, 앞으로의 일을 말하는 미래형을 배워요 — Ich <strong>hatte</strong> schon <strong>gegessen</strong>. · Ich <strong>werde</strong> morgen <strong>kommen</strong>.</div></div></section><section id=\"solutions\" class=\"solutions\"><h2 class=\"sol-title\">Lösungen — 정답 모아보기</h2><div class=\"sol-grid\"><div><b>16·23·24과 복습</b>1. -er · 2. -e · 3. -en · 4. Wegen</div><div><b>형태 만들기</b>1. kleiner · 2. besser · 3. am ältesten · 4. jünger · 5. höher · 6. am größten · 7. lieber · 8. teurer</div><div><b>비교하기</b>1. als · 2. wie · 3. ich · 4. lieber · 5. viel · 6. wie</div><div><b>명사 앞 비교급·최상급</b>1. -e · 2. -e · 3. -es · 4. -en · 5. mehr</div><div><b>zu · sehr · genug</b>1. Der Kuchen ist sehr lecker! · 2. zu · 3. Wir haben genug Zeit. · 4. Das Zimmer ist hell genug. · 5. zu</div><div><b>실수 피하기</b>1. Der Film ist spannender als das Buch. · 2. Das ist das teuerste Restaurant. · 3. Mein Zimmer ist größer als deins. · 4. Je mehr ich lese, desto mehr verstehe ich.</div></div></section>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>\n"